            "review_title": "Review at Yen Restaurant & Chao Bar",
            "review_text": "Ron M\n8 contributions\n0\nSunday morning wake up place\nFeb 2016\nAt this time it's not in the sun and not to much people around So you can grab a drink, enjoy the wifi and chill here in the evening as well. The view is nice and the staff don't put pressure on you to order something. perfect to read the Sunday paper and have your breakfast. although the food might be not the best If you feel like having dinner here it would be a great idea too.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 21, 2016",
