            "review_title": "Review at Yen Restaurant & Chao Bar",
            "review_text": "Takumi\nDa Nang, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nNot only the first time to visit here...\nFeb 2016 • Solo\nChao Bar on the 11th floor so great place for reading and relax the mind and body with the breeze almost time. The ideal time would be from 5.15 to 6.15 for reading outside on the terrace, but depending on the weather of the day. So we can come to Chao Bar more earlier than normal to enjoy the reading and its panoramic view of the Saigon. I can guarantee that it would be less noise and less air pollution. The important thing would not make you disappointed is the good quality of drinks and the list price which is very competitive in the town. I will come back here again for every weekend :).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 21, 2016",
