            "review_title": "Review at Yen Restaurant & Chao Bar",
            "review_text": "Takumi\nDa Nang, Vietnam7 contributions\n0\nThe best place for dating and talking\nAug 2014 • Couples\nIt's quite hard to find a new place which can make my friend saying WOW. Luckily for me to remember a recommendation of Chào Bar. It's a terrace bar on 11th floor of a 3* hotel. It's great because of: - Terrace bar with a view of 180 degree which let you see the beauty of sky and Saigon downtown. - The price is so competitive with prices of coffee from 20,000 to 45,000. Cocktail price a little higher with 80,000 but good value for your money. - Decoration of the bar looks like a tropical resort with bamboo and colorful light. Yes, it made my friend and me saying WOW. Sure! we will come back here again. But I hope next time it's not rain to let us last our dating longer :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 1, 2014",
